{
  "about": "What /api/health and /api/system/capabilities answered before they became one Vercel function. Captured at commit 3a22e82 by calling the two old handlers (apps/portal/api/health.ts and apps/portal/api/system/capabilities.ts) once per case, with the env of that case set and every other name in envKeys unset. Body keys are in the order the old handler wrote them. \"<process.version>\" stands for the running Node version. If you change one of these responses on purpose, update the matching entry in the same commit.",
